  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigaacha asende naende, riganteebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninki engencho y’omorabaaro oyo okoiranererwa gokwanwa ase ense y’Abaisraeli:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaise barire amasabibu amabese amaroro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na amaino y’abana babo abeire n’obokang’iti?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene Nyasae nigo agoteeba iga: Ekeene buna inche inde moyo, timokogenderera gokwana omorabaaro oyo ase ense y’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naama! Emioyo y’ abanto bonsi ney’ane; koreng’ana buna omoyo o ise ore oyone, boigo noyo bw’omwana ore oyone. Omonto oyio ogokora ebibe, nere orakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Origererie orore omonto ore omooronge, ogokora ayare boronge na ekeene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere tari koria ebing’wanso bikoruegwa igoro ase ebitunwa, gose tari korigereria emegwekano y’Abaisraeli bagosasiima; tari gokora obonyaka n’omokuungu bw’omonto onde, gose tari koba nomokuungu ekero are nomotienyi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gose tari gokorera monto onde bobe, korende nigo akoirania egento omonto amoete koba intenenera ase esiira. Ere tari koura onde gento kiaye, korende nigo akoa oyore nenchara endagera, na oyore getirianda omobekera eanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero akorua singo tari kwementera gento gose koboria ebitoki. Nigo agotanga amaboko aye takora obobe; nigo akonacha ekiina kia boronge ase egati y’omonto na omonto onde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyio aise gokora bo, na abwatie emeroberio y’ane echiikire, na abwate amachiiko ane, na akore ayare boronge, oyio nigo are omonyaboronge; ekeene, nabe moyo. Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ande omonto oyio nabe ng’a oiboire omwana omomura oyore omoibi na omoiti, gose abe ogokora erimo ri’ayio",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ise omonyene atakorete, korende arie ebing’wanso bikoruegwa ase ebitunwa igoro, naende akore obonyaka nomokuungu bw’omonto onde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere nigo agokorera abataka na abaremerwa bobe, na kourereria abanto ebinto biabo, gose tari koirania egento aetwe koba intenenera, ere nigo akorigereria emegwekano egosasiimwa na gokora ay’okogechia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero akorua singo nigo akwementera egento ase okoboria ebitoki. Inee! Omonto buna oyio nabe moyo? Yaya takoba moyo. Ekiagera akorire okogechia okwo gwonsi goika akwe. Okomocha kw’ogoiteka kw’amanyinga aye ’nkobe igoro yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ande omonto oyio nabe ng’a oiboire omwana omomura, ere arore ebibe bionsi ise akorete, korende airoke na takora amang’ana buna ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere taria ebing’wanso bikoruerwa ase ebitunwa igoro, gose tarigereria emegwekano y’Abaisraeli bagosasiima, gose takora obonyaka n’omokuungu bw’omonto onde;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tagokorera monto onde bobe, gose takoira egento koba intenenera, gose takourereria omonto enibo yaye, korende nigo arabe okoa oyore nenchara endagera, na oyore getirianda amobekere eanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende nigo aratange okoboko kwaye takorera oyochandegete bobe, na abe tari koboria ebitoki gose kwementera egento, korende nigo arendete amachiiko ane na kobwatia emeroberio y’ane echiikire. Oyio tagokwa ase engencho y’ebibe bia ise, korende ekeene, goika abe moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ise ere ekiagera akorerete abanto bobe ase obotindi, na akaurereria oyomwabo, naende agakora aya atarenge amaya ase egati y’ abanto baye, ekeene, ere goika akwe ase engencho y’ebibe biaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe nigo mokoboria: Ninki keragere omwana atanyore emechando ase engencho y’ebibe bia ise? Nigo nkobairaneria iga: Ekero omwana akorire ayare amaya na amaronge, na obeire okorenda emeroberio y’ane echiikire na ayekore, ekeene, nabe moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto ogokora ebibe nere orakwe. Omwana tagochandwa ase engencho y’ebibe bia ise, gose ise tagochandwa ase engencho y’ebibe bi’omwana oye. Omonyaboronge nanyore eng’eria y’oboronge bwaye, na omonyabibe nanyore eng’eria y’obobe bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasae nigo akogoka ekero omonyabibe akoonchoka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omokori amabe karatige ebibe biaye bionsi ebio akorire, na arende emeroberio y’ane yonsi echiikire, naende akore ayare amaya na amaronge, ekeene, nabe moyo, tagokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebibe biaye bionsi akorete tibikoinyorwa, erinde agambigwe, korende nabe moyo, ekiagera akorire ayare ay’oboronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro Omonene akoboria; Inee! Aye nigo okagete ng’a inche nigo ingokirie nogokwa kw’omokori amabe? Yaya, nigo ’nganetie omokori amabe aonchoke, atige enchera yaye embe abe moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende omonyaboronge karatige oboronge bwaye na akore ebibe, naende akore okogechia okwo omokori amabe agokora, Inee, oyio nabe moyo? Yaya, oboronge bwaye bwonsi obwo konya akorire tibokoinyorwa; goika akwe, ekiagera atabeete omwegenwa, korende agakora ebibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inwe nigo mogoteeba: Enchera y’Omonene teri endonge. Inwe Abaisraeli, igwa bono: Inee! Enchera y’ane nero etari endonge? Chinchera chiaino, tari chirochio chitari chindonge?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omonto omonyaboronge akoonchoka otiga gokora ay’oboronge, erio okora ebibe, oyio goika akwe ase engencho y’ayio; ee, ase engencho y’ebibe akorire goika akwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omokori amabe karaonchoke atige ebibe akorire, na akore ayare amaya na ayare boronge, oyio natoorie omoyo oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiagera arengereirie aya akorete na aonchokire korwa ase ogosaria kwaye gwonsi akorete, ekeene, nabe moyo, tagokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Abaisraeli nigo bagoteeba: Enchera y’Omonene teri endonge. Inwe Abaisraeli, chinchera chiane nachio chitari chindonge? Inee! Chinchera chiaino tari chirochio chitari chindonge?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
