              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya naro inche Omonene, ’ngoteeba: Inwe Abaisraeli ase engencho y’ayio nimbanachere ekiina, kera omonto anacherwe buna chinchera chiaye chire. Onchoka! Motige ogosaria kwaino gwonsi, erinde obobe bwaino tiboba ekegocha gi’okobasiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Motugute ogosaria kwaino gwonsi, okwo mwakorire asende, mwenyorere chinkoro chinyia na omoika omoyia. Inwe Abaisraeli, nase ki moganetie gokwa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche tingokiri nogokwa kw’omonto onde bwensi ase ayio oonchoka mobe moyo. Nabo Omonene ateebire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.32",
